功尽数收入藏经阁，供弟子修习参阅；设置每名弟子的工作重心，因材施教，并率领他们惩奸除恶或横行霸道；最终将自己的门派建设成江湖中一支举足轻重之力量。\n\n乱世是专属于侠客的舞台，你可以招贤纳士，合纵连横，率领弟子与其他门派一较高下，攻占并且吞并敌方的城池。或许终有一日能够一统神州，成就万世之功业！","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/bc4c2ec5f266b3f67a276dc6a253f86b3457e458/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1786432843"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/3d12ccfdfba2170f3e2acc5aec22d54c50336619/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1786432843"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/extras/43cd647304b98ee0253b0062bc5a3592.webp?t=1786432843","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/extras/6840ab87b32b0c84427f5fce3b2c3d3e.webp?t=1786432843","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/extras/39be1e7e974f62f13427d7f58ef34efb.webp?t=1786432843","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/extras/024ca04b5e877b02e17a419edf2cc62e.webp?t=1786432843","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/extras/4aeb9f215b9efcaf9bd335d9315670d8.avif?t=1786432843","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/cee9a8a36900f017f445c507e75e70f792f9d6cc/ss_cee9a8a36900f017f445c507e75e70f792f9d6cc.600x338.jpg?t=1786432843","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202030/cee9a8a36900f017f445c507e75e70f792f9d6cc/ss_cee9a8a36900f017f445c507e75e70f792f9d6cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786432843"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://sha